        <mxCell id="design-principle-title" value="⚠️ 와이어프레임 설계 원칙" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1060" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="design-principle-content" value="이 와이어프레임은 API 응답에서 직접 제공되는 데이터만 표시합니다.&#xa;&#xa;제거된 항목:&#xa;• 전체 통계 섹션: 모든 Job의 count_by_status를 합산해야 하므로 API가 직접 제공하지 않음&#xa;• 필터 상태별 개수: 각 Job의 주요 상태를 판단해야 하므로 프론트엔드 로직 필요&#xa;  - 예: &quot;✅ 완료 (0)&quot; → &quot;✅ 완료&quot;로 변경&#xa;• 상태 필터 버튼: API에 status 파라미터가 없으므로 완전히 제거&#xa;  - API 필터: job_id, work_type, task_id만 지원&#xa;  - 유지: total 필드로 알 수 있는 &quot;전체 Job 개수&quot;&#xa;&#xa;프론트엔드에서 필요 시 각 Job의 count_by_status를 분석하여 통계 및 필터링 구현 가능" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1090" width="1460" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <!-- API 기본 정보 -->
        <mxCell id="api-basic-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1180" width="1460" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="api-basic-title" value="🔗 API 기본 정보" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1190" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="api-basic-content" value="엔드포인트: GET /catv/stb/control/results&#xa;쿼리 파라미터:&#xa;• limit: 조회 개수 (기본 100, 최대 1000)&#xa;• offset: 시작 위치 (기본 0, 최대 uint64)&#xa;• job_id: Job ID 필터 (선택)&#xa;• work_type: 제어 명령 필터 (선택)&#xa;• task_id: Task ID 필터 (선택)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1220" width="1460" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <!-- 응답 구조 -->
        <mxCell id="response-structure-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1320" width="1460" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="response-structure-title" value="📦 응답 JSON 구조" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1330" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="response-structure-content" value="{&#xa;  &quot;total&quot;: 3,                    // 전체 매칭 Job 개수&#xa;  &quot;limit&quot;: 100,                   // 조회 개수&#xa;  &quot;offset&quot;: 0,                    // 시작 위치&#xa;  &quot;filters&quot;: {                     // 적용된 필터&#xa;    &quot;job_id&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#xa;    &quot;work_type&quot;: &quot;&quot;,&#xa;    &quot;task_id&quot;: &quot;&quot;&#xa;  },&#xa;  &quot;items&quot;: [                       // Job 목록&#xa;    {&#xa;      &quot;request_received_at&quot;: &quot;2026-02-12T02:34:52Z&quot;,&#xa;      &quot;job_id&quot;: &quot;5c26dadd-c8ca-41ef-9e41-904d7c029fbd&quot;,&#xa;      &quot;task_ids&quot;: [&quot;...-0&quot;, &quot;...-1&quot;, &quot;...-2&quot;, &quot;...-3&quot;],&#xa;      &quot;work_type&quot;: &quot;stb_request_info&quot;,&#xa;      &quot;count_by_status&quot;: {&quot;completed&quot;: 28640, &quot;failed&quot;: 51125, &quot;running&quot;: 1341, &quot;pending&quot;: 0}&#xa;    }&#xa;  ]&#xa;}" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#82b366;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="90" y="1365" width="1420" height="145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <!-- count_by_status 집계 -->
        <mxCell id="aggregation-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1540" width="1460" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="aggregation-title" value="📊 count_by_status 집계 방식" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1550" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="aggregation-content" value="ClickHouse 쿼리:&#xa;SELECT&#xa;  request_received_at, job_id, groupUniqArray(task_id) as task_ids, any(work_type) as work_type,&#xa;  sumMap(map(task_status, 1)) as count_by_status&#xa;FROM dist_stb_control_job&#xa;WHERE [필터 조건]&#xa;GROUP BY request_received_at, job_id&#xa;ORDER BY request_received_at DESC&#xa;LIMIT ? OFFSET ?&#xa;&#xa;• sumMap 함수: 각 task_status 값을 키로, 개수를 값으로 하는 맵 생성 후 합산&#xa;• 결과: {&quot;pending&quot;: N, &quot;running&quot;: N, &quot;completed&quot;: N, &quot;failed&quot;: N}" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=9;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1580" width="1460" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <!-- result_code 해석 -->
        <mxCell id="result-code-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff3cd;strokeColor=#ffc107;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1700" width="1460" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="result-code-title" value="⚠️ result_code 및 실패 케이스 해석" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1710" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="result-code-content" value="result_code 값:&#xa;• &quot;&quot; (빈 문자열): K8s Job 생성 실패 또는 Worker 실행 전&#xa;  - task_error_message에 상세 원인 기록 (예: &quot;failed to create K8s job&quot;)&#xa;  - 모든 STB가 failed 상태로 처리됨&#xa;• &quot;1&quot;: 성공 - STB가 명령을 정상적으로 수행&#xa;• &quot;0&quot;: 장비 에러 - wrong parameter, not supported 등&#xa;• &quot;-1&quot;: 시스템 에러 - timeout, connection refused, network unreachable 등&#xa;&#xa;실제 운영 데이터 분석 (2026-02-12):&#xa;• Job 2, 3: 전체 실패 (result_code 빈 문자열) → K8s Job 생성 실패로 추정&#xa;• Job 1: 혼합 상태 (완료 35.3%, 실패 63.0%, 실행중 1.7%) → 정상 처리 중" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1740" width="1460" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <!-- 정렬 및 필터 -->
        <mxCell id="sorting-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1850" width="1460" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="sorting-title" value="🔍 정렬 및 필터" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1860" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="sorting-content" value="정렬: request_received_at DESC (최신 Job이 먼저 표시)&#xa;필터링 지원:&#xa;• job_id: 특정 Job ID로 필터 (정확히 일치)&#xa;• work_type: 제어 명령으로 필터 (정확히 일치)&#xa;• task_id: Task ID로 필터 (LIKE 검색)&#xa;Total count: 필터 조건과 매칭되는 전체 Job 개수 (limit/offset 무관)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1890" width="1460" height="50" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <!-- 제한 상수 -->
        <mxCell id="limits-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dee2e6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1970" width="1460" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="limits-title" value="📏 제한 상수" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="1980" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="limits-content" value="MaxJobListLimit = 1000      // 최대 조회 개수&#xa;DefaultJobListLimit = 100   // 기본 조회 개수&#xa;MaxOffsetValue = math.MaxUint64  // 최대 오프셋 (18,446,744,073,709,551,615)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2010" width="1460" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <!-- 실제 데이터 분석 -->
        <mxCell id="real-data-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2080" width="1460" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="real-data-title" value="📈 실제 운영 데이터 분석 (2026-02-12)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2090" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="real-data-content" value="전체 3개 Job, 총 241,559대 STB 제어 시도:&#xa;&#xa;Job 1 (5c26dadd-...):&#xa;• 요청 시각: 2026-02-12 11:34:52 KST&#xa;• 총 81,106대: 완료 28,640 (35.3%), 실패 51,125 (63.0%), 실행중 1,341 (1.7%)&#xa;• 정상 처리 중 (혼합 상태)&#xa;&#xa;Job 2 (1bb928ee-...):&#xa;• 요청 시각: 2026-02-11 16:05:15 KST&#xa;• 총 80,227대: 실패 100% (result_code 빈 문자열) → K8s Job 생성 실패&#xa;&#xa;Job 3 (6301010c-...):&#xa;• 요청 시각: 2026-02-11 16:04:47 KST&#xa;• 총 80,226대: 실패 100% (result_code 빈 문자열) → K8s Job 생성 실패" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2120" width="1460" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <!-- 다음 단계 -->
        <mxCell id="next-step-box" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;arcSize=5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2260" width="1460" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="next-step-title" value="▶ 다음 단계: 특정 Job 상세 조회" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2270" width="300" height="25" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <mxCell id="next-step-content" value="특정 Job의 STB별 상세 결과 조회:&#xa;GET /catv/stb/control/results/:job_id?limit=1000&amp;offset=0&#xa;&#xa;필터 옵션:&#xa;• cm_mac: CM MAC 주소&#xa;• stb_mac: STB MAC 주소&#xa;• status: pending, running, completed, failed&#xa;• result: &quot;1&quot;, &quot;0&quot;, &quot;-1&quot;, &quot;&quot;&#xa;• task_id: Task ID (LIKE 검색)&#xa;&#xa;→ 각 STB별 result_code, result_message, 실행 시각 등 상세 정보 확인 가능" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=15;spacingTop=5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2300" width="1460" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
        <!-- 푸터 -->
        <mxCell id="footer" value="GET /catv/stb/control/results | 와이어프레임 + 개발자 노트" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#f8f9fa;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#6c757d;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="2400" width="1460" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
